Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.08,0:01:06.96,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(968,846)}包谷老师滑浪学校
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.25,0:01:08.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.25,0:01:08.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh my word
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.80,0:01:19.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:19.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.72,0:01:23.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尤金
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:23.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Eugene
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.31,0:01:26.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的驾校全毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.31,0:01:26.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My school is ruined
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.69,0:01:28.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别难过  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.69,0:01:28.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There, there, dear
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.10,0:01:32.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得一直关校到全都收拾干净为止
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.10,0:01:29.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll have to close down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:32.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,until I get everything cleaned up
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.19,0:01:35.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁知道要收拾多久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.19,0:01:35.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who knows how long it could take
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.36,0:01:38.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这不是真的吧  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.36,0:01:38.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say it ain't so, Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.41,0:01:40.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁会干这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.41,0:01:40.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who could do such a thing?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.49,0:01:42.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来没法知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.49,0:01:42.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I suppose we'll never know
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.75,0:01:45.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好回去工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:45.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I better get back to work
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.41,0:01:46.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我钱可不会自己数自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:46.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me money won't count itself
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.75,0:01:47.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:47.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.50,0:01:50.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道要怎么不会没法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.50,0:01:50.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know how we could not never know
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.17,0:01:51.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:51.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say what now?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.21,0:01:53.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们有最厉害的探子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.21,0:01:53.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We have the greatest gumshoe
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.59,0:01:55.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最敏锐的包打听
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.59,0:01:55.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the sharpest shamus
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.30,0:01:58.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最有眼力的私家侦探  就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:58.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the privatest of eyes, right here
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.64,0:02:01.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说的就是章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:01.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.39,0:02:03.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他能解开这桩谜案
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:03.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He'll solve this mystery
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.51,0:02:04.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:04.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not interested
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.43,0:02:08.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了求你了求你了  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.43,0:02:08.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, please, please, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.19,0:02:09.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看在泡芙老师份上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:09.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For Mrs. Puff's sake?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.65,0:02:11.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:11.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.31,0:02:13.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我舒服得很
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.31,0:02:13.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I'm very comfortable
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.19,0:02:16.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有什么能让我离开这
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.19,0:02:16.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that could possibly move me from--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.40,0:02:21.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:21.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.24,0:02:22.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,转念一想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:22.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,On second thought
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.33,0:02:24.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绝不能让一位女士深陷水深火热之中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:24.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd never leave a dame in distress
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.37,0:02:25.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这案子我接了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:25.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll take the case
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.33,0:02:30.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,雨水如铁锤般砸向地面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:30.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The rain hammered down
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.38,0:02:33.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就像整座城市都是钉子做的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.38,0:02:33.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like the whole city was made of nails
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.09,0:02:34.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我并不在意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:34.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I didn't mind
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.71,0:02:36.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它与我此刻的心情相配
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.71,0:02:36.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It matched my mood
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.96,0:02:39.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又一个夜晚  又一桩谜案
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:39.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Another night, another mystery
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.47,0:02:41.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又要出动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:41.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,another case for
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.26,0:02:43.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:43.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward Tentacles
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.18,0:02:45.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爵士神探
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:45.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jazz Detective
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.68,0:02:51.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开船的时候请少放标题字幕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:49.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please refrain from using titles
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:51.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,while the vehicle is in motion
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.27,0:02:53.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那么  说说看事情经过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:53.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So, tell me what happened
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.94,0:02:56.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有个白痴在你学校乱涂乱画吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:56.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Some sap scribbled on your school?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.57,0:02:57.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看了就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.57,0:02:57.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll see
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.61,0:03:00.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那可是灾难
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.61,0:03:00.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a disaster
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.49,0:03:06.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你有死对头吗  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:06.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You have any enemies, Mrs. Puff?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.91,0:03:10.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有没有人想把你赶出驾校这行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.91,0:03:08.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anyone who would want to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.41,0:03:10.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,out of the boating school racket?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.75,0:03:11.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:11.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.75,0:03:13.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:13.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh my, no
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.33,0:03:16.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我以前认识的人都不知道我在裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.33,0:03:16.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No one from my past even knows I'm in Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.38,0:03:18.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:18.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just as well
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.09,0:03:21.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里的轮胎印只有我们船的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.09,0:03:21.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Our boat tracks are the only ones here
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.76,0:03:23.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嫌犯一定是步行离开的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:23.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The perp must've walked
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.59,0:03:26.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,目标一定就在这座镇上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.59,0:03:26.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're looking for someone from town
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.56,0:03:30.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我前几天确实跟拉里起了点小摩擦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:29.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I did have a small kerfuffle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:30.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with Larry the other day
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.94,0:03:31.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:31.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.10,0:03:35.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这些划痕很有可能是用龙虾爪弄的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:35.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,These slashes could've been made with a lobster claw
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.23,0:03:38.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来是时候续费健身房会员了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.23,0:03:38.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's time to renew our gym memberships
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.36,0:03:39.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:39.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我只能步行回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm walking home
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.29,0:03:55.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里向来头脑简单四肢发达
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:55.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry always had more brawn than brains
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.38,0:03:56.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但破坏公物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:56.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but a vandal?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.92,0:03:58.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可不至于
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:03:58.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't see it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:04.89,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(560,366)}拉里健身房
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.63,0:04:01.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但在这行工作  还是得跟着线索走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.63,0:04:01.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Still, in this line of work you follow the clues
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.59,0:04:04.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,即便是被引入了龙虾笼中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:04.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,even when they lead you into a lobster trap
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.89,0:04:06.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那晚正在举行一场大格斗赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:06.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was the night of the big fight
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.93,0:04:10.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,半个裤头村都过来看谁会赢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.93,0:04:10.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Half the town was here to see who would prevail
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.48,0:04:14.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,究竟是健壮男爵  肌肉大师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:14.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The baron of beefiness, the master of muscle
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.27,0:04:15.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,龙虾拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:15.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry the Lobster
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.31,0:04:18.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是挑战者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:18.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or the challenger
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.44,0:04:20.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,助步器老头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:20.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Old Man Walker
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.03,0:04:21.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:21.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.65,0:04:26.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从没感到这么有活力过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.65,0:04:26.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never felt so alive
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.74,0:04:30.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:30.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.58,0:04:32.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:32.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.00,0:04:34.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要问你几个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:34.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We have a few questions for you
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.67,0:04:36.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里乐意帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:36.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry's happy to help
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.71,0:04:38.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么样的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:38.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What sort of questions?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.17,0:04:39.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,交给我  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:39.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.30,0:04:41.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天空为什么是蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:41.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why is the sky blue?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蛤蜊下雨时会飞向哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where do clams go when it rains?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.55,0:04:46.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么有时候白天会出月亮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:46.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why is the moon out during the day sometimes?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.55,0:04:52.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听说你前几天跟泡芙老师起过争执
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:49.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We heard you had a little dust-up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:52.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with Mrs. Puff the other day
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,介意细说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mind filling us in?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.81,0:04:54.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:54.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.64,0:04:56.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她本来在举重
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:56.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She was lifting weights
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.10,0:04:57.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,突然膨胀了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:57.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,suddenly inflated
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.65,0:05:00.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就把我的杠铃撑弯了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.65,0:05:00.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and then she bent my barbell, bro
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.03,0:05:06.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你认为那种程度足以让你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:06.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And would you say that was enough to make you
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.53,0:05:08.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,寻求报复吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.53,0:05:08.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,seek revenge?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.66,0:05:09.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,报复
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:09.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Revenge?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.78,0:05:11.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才不会呢  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:11.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No way, bro
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.58,0:05:13.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里可是温和的巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:13.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry's a gentle giant
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.67,0:05:19.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果你没故意给滑浪学校搞破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.67,0:05:19.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you didn't vandalize the boating school
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.79,0:05:21.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那要怎么解释
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:21.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how do you explain
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.59,0:05:24.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.59,0:05:24.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,this?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.13,0:05:26.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,轮胎印
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:26.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tread marks
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.34,0:05:30.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟你划破泡芙老师轮胎留的印子一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:30.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just like you'd get from slashing Mrs. Puff's tires
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.43,0:05:31.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:31.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.06,0:05:32.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里可以解释
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:32.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry can explain
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.40,0:05:41.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,装那些东西是为了让拉里的手套能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:41.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All that was in there to make Larry's gloves, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.77,0:05:42.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更软一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:42.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,even softer?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.40,0:05:46.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:46.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My turn
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.53,0:05:49.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赢家出炉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:49.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The winner
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.37,0:05:51.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我赢了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:51.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did I win?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.16,0:05:53.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们要带我去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:53.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are you taking me?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.95,0:05:55.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:55.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.58,0:05:59.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这场拳击赛也击垮了我们的案子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:59.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This boxing match was a KO for our case, too
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.21,0:06:00.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里没有线索
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:00.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No leads here
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.63,0:06:04.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下解不开这起案子了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:04.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're never gonna solve this case
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.21,0:06:06.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们还没被打败
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.21,0:06:06.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're not licked yet
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.59,0:06:09.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有个地方  我们总能去那找线索
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.59,0:06:09.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's one place we can always go for a lead
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.51,0:06:12.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全裤头村最恶劣的场所
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:12.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the most wretched joint in all of Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.18,0:06:15.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,强人俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:15.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Salty Spitoon
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.73,0:06:18.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,假如有谁知道那个破坏者的情报
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:18.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If anyone knows anything about our vandal
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.60,0:06:22.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那必然是莎莉的一位恶棍常客
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:22.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it'll be one of Sally's lowlife patrons
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.02,0:06:24.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们家的奶昔做得还挺好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:24.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And they make a pretty good milkshake
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.44,0:06:26.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:26.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yippee
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:32.58,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(556,348)}强人俱乐部
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.19,0:06:32.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,强人俱乐部一如记忆中那样阴湿沉闷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:30.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Salty Spitoon was just as dank
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:32.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and dreary as I remembered
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.87,0:06:36.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这地方完全是裤头村的底层
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:36.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This place was truly the bottom of Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.71,0:06:40.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我的搭档说对了一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:40.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My partner was right about one thing, though
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.33,0:06:43.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们家的奶昔确实很好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:43.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They did make a pretty good milkshake
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.21,0:06:45.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的是草莓味的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:45.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mine was strawberry
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.67,0:06:50.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:50.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.09,0:06:52.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该来问点问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.09,0:06:52.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to start asking some questions
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.97,0:06:53.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.97,0:06:53.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You there
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.10,0:06:56.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你有多了解那个滑浪学
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:56.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you know about the boating school--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.68,0:06:58.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:58.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.52,0:06:59.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别放那首歌了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:06:59.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quit playing that song
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.31,0:07:03.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说回滑浪学校
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.31,0:07:03.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So, back to the boating school--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.61,0:07:07.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我叫你别再放那首歌了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.61,0:07:07.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I told you not to play that again, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.69,0:07:08.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:08.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.69,0:07:09.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经投了20块
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.69,0:07:09.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I put a 20 in
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.82,0:07:13.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,选了我最爱的歌  单曲循环一百遍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:13.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and already picked my favorite song 100 times in a row
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.24,0:07:16.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还剩98遍没放
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:16.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Only 98 more times to go
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.21,0:07:21.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:21.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm okay
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.50,0:07:24.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还挺强人的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:24.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tough guy, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.25,0:07:25.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:25.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.00,0:07:29.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  我们这边就爱这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:29.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nah, that's the sort of thing we like around here
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.72,0:07:32.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说实话  都已经强人到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:32.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In fact, it was so tough
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.01,0:07:34.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都想告诉你们点情报了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:34.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I might have a little info for you
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.85,0:07:38.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我认识一个人  他既恨学校又爱画画
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:38.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know someone who hates school and likes painting
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.89,0:07:40.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可能就是你们要找的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:40.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This might be your guy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.10,0:07:42.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这家伙有名字吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:42.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This guy got a name?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.69,0:07:43.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:43.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure does
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.48,0:07:45.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,红鲱鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:45.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Red Herring
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.98,0:07:47.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.98,0:07:47.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.44,0:07:50.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都叫那种名字了  一定是我们找的罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:50.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With a name like that, he has to be our perp
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:50.57,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 红鲱鱼：比喻转移注意力的次要事实 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.57,0:07:51.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们找的罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:51.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Our perp
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.45,0:07:52.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们找的罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.45,0:07:52.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Our perp
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.32,0:07:52.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:52.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Our--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.07,0:07:54.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.07,0:07:54.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.70,0:07:57.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去把红鲱鱼钓上来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:57.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're gonna hook us a Red Herring
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.04,0:07:59.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥快看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:07:59.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.12,0:08:00.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:00.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That must be him
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.33,0:08:03.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听好了  小混混
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:03.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen up, punk
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.71,0:08:06.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我问问题  你就必须回答
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:06.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got questions, and you're gonna answer them
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.21,0:08:09.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在是来软的  听到没
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.21,0:08:09.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,real easy-like, you hear?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.17,0:08:10.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:10.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.84,0:08:12.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:12.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or what?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.80,0:08:17.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然我的搭档问话就要来硬的了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:17.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or my partner will get the answers the hard way
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.39,0:08:23.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:23.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.44,0:08:24.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那种事情不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:24.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything but that
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.56,0:08:25.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:25.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll talk
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.27,0:08:25.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.27,0:08:25.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll talk
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.15,0:08:26.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.15,0:08:26.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.06,0:08:29.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你名字叫红鲱鱼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:29.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is your name Red Herring?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.65,0:08:31.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  你怎么知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.65,0:08:31.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, how'd you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.07,0:08:35.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听说你恨学校  爱画画
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.07,0:08:35.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We heard you hate school and love to paint
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.45,0:08:37.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们就看到了你的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:37.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then we saw your, uh
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:40.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1576,522)}苯旦才上学
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.16,0:08:38.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,作品
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:38.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,work
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.16,0:08:39.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:39.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.79,0:08:40.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:40.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's wrong wit' it?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.87,0:08:42.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.87,0:08:42.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.58,0:08:44.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们不是来批判你错别字的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:44.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're not here about your spelling
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.92,0:08:49.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是来问你昨晚破坏滑浪学校的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:47.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're here about the boating school
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.63,0:08:49.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you vandalized last night
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.17,0:08:51.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,昨晚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:51.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Last night?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.80,0:08:53.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不可能是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:53.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It couldn't have been me
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.55,0:08:59.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在电视直播主持我的公共绘画节目
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:59.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was hosting my public access painting show on live TV
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.43,0:09:02.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在这个角落
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.43,0:09:02.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And in this corner
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.56,0:09:07.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要破坏几棵树  就为了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:07.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we'll vandalize some little trees, just for us
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.81,0:09:09.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,电视直播吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:09.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Live TV, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,挺充分的不在场证明
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pretty good alibi
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.86,0:09:14.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我们抓错鱼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:14.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like we caught the wrong fish
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.16,0:09:21.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下找不到要找的罪犯了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:21.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're never gonna find our perp
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他不会有事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.79,0:09:28.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不见得
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:28.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I doubt it
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.54,0:09:32.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他向来都很有事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:32.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He was never okay to begin with
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.59,0:09:37.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  看不出来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.59,0:09:37.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Squidward, don't you see?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.59,0:09:39.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是再解不开这起案子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:39.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If we don't solve this case
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.43,0:09:42.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师就再也开不了滑浪学校
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:42.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff may never open her boating school again
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.35,0:09:46.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就再也上不了驾校课了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:46.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll never get to take another boating lesson
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.52,0:09:49.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.52,0:09:49.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.73,0:09:50.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:50.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.40,0:09:55.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来只能步行回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:55.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm walking home
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.03,0:10:02.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.03,0:10:02.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.71,0:10:11.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:11.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.92,0:10:12.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:12.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You here?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.09,0:10:15.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,案子解开了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.09,0:10:15.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I solved the case
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.42,0:10:17.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.42,0:10:17.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.80,0:10:18.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:18.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Indeed
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.26,0:10:21.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,神秘破坏者的真实身份
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:21.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The identity of our mysterious vandal
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.56,0:10:24.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:24.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.81,0:10:26.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.81,0:10:26.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.14,0:10:30.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你昨晚在场
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:30.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were here last night
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.19,0:10:32.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你破坏了你自己的学校
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.19,0:10:32.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You vandalized your own school
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.52,0:10:35.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在众人面前哭诉装无辜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:35.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You cried in front of everyone to seem innocent
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.07,0:10:38.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你所做的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:38.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you did it all
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.24,0:10:43.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就只是不给海绵宝宝再上一节驾驶课
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:40.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just to get out of giving SpongeBob
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:43.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,another boating lesson
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很好  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Very good, Mr. Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.21,0:10:50.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被你发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:50.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got me
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.92,0:10:52.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但既然你知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:52.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But now that you know
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.84,0:10:55.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就不能让你毁了我的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.84,0:10:55.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't have you ruining my plans
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.55,0:10:59.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:10:59.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.30,0:11:02.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说知道  不代表那关我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:02.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said I know, I didn't say I care
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.18,0:11:05.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说实话  我觉得那主意挺不错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:05.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In fact, I think it's a great idea
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.85,0:11:07.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:07.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.18,0:11:09.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,第二天早上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.31,0:11:19.74,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(270,358)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.73,0:11:12.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的餐厅怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:12.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened to me restaurant?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.98,0:11:16.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得等你收拾干净才能开门
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:16.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We can't open until you clean this place up
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.40,0:11:17.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快去干活
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:17.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, get to work
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.82,0:11:19.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,遵命  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:19.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:22.57,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1176,750)}欢迎来到酷乐湖
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.79,0:11:34.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,案件终结了  海绵宝宝引开了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:34.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Case closed, SpongeBob distracted
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.92,0:11:36.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,工作翘了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:36.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,work avoided
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.55,0:11:38.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又一起谜案  破案者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.55,0:11:38.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Another mystery solved
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.38,0:11:41.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正是  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:41.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,by Squidward Tentacles
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.30,0:11:43.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爵士神探
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:43.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jazz Detective
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.97,0:11:50.56,起司 一般标题,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H00FFC1&}没好花园
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:51.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(752,430)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:51.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(770,722)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:56.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1530,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:53.40,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(680,586)}指导总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:54.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(758,540)}制片
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.15,0:11:56.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(596,560)}监制
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:58.03,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(640,598)}监制
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:58.03,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1468.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.11,0:12:01.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的花园好完美
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.11,0:12:01.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My garden is perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.99,0:12:08.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今年裤头村园艺大赛我一定会得头奖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:04.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sure to win first prize
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:08.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in this year's Bikini Bottom Garden Competition
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.49,0:12:12.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,前往地中海海床的豪华旅游
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.49,0:12:12.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A luxury trip to the Mediterranean seabed
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.17,0:12:16.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,沐浴在阳光下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:16.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Basking in the sun
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.00,0:12:19.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全身涂满橄榄油  晒着日光浴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:19.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,olive oil covering my suntanning body
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.25,0:12:21.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃着藤上摘下来的葡萄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:21.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,eating grapes off the vine
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最棒的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and best of all
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.01,0:12:26.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:26.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,no SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.72,0:12:27.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:27.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.98,0:12:32.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:32.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.06,0:12:32.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你从哪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:32.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where did
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.56,0:12:33.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你你你  想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:33.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What-what-what do you want?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.14,0:12:37.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想跟你说我有多么爱你的花园
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.14,0:12:37.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wanted to tell you how much I love your garden
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.69,0:12:38.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:38.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.77,0:12:40.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.77,0:12:40.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.20,0:12:46.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  这些花让这里漂亮多了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:46.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, the flowers really spruce up the place
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.41,0:12:47.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但你也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:47.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But you know
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.16,0:12:51.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚还说你喜欢我花园
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:51.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You said you loved my garden
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.33,0:12:52.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:52.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.75,0:12:54.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是有一点小建议
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:54.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just have some notes
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.58,0:12:55.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还建议呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.58,0:12:55.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Notes?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.25,0:12:57.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然你这么懂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:57.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, if you know so much about it
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.42,0:12:59.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就自己种自己的花园去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:12:59.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,go plant your own garden
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.88,0:13:01.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:01.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great idea, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.46,0:13:03.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我马上办
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:03.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll dig right in
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:03.72,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1056,920)}挖
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.93,0:13:13.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等  万一海绵宝宝真的很会园艺呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:13.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, what if SpongeBob really is good at gardening?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.60,0:13:15.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才不会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:15.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nah
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.64,0:13:18.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他缺少艺术眼力  园艺天赋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:18.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He lacks the artistic eye, the green thumb
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.65,0:13:21.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有大脑灰质  不可能赢过我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:21.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and the gray matter to compete with me
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.24,0:13:25.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得睡个美容觉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:25.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need a beauty nap
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.03,0:13:28.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,领头奖得容光焕发才行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.03,0:13:28.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotta look fresh when I'm accepting first prize
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:33.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,一场美容觉之后
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.00,0:13:37.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,睡醒之后容光焕发
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:37.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I awaken refreshed
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.25,0:13:37.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:37.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.75,0:13:38.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:38.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what the what?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.63,0:13:46.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,觉得我的花园怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.63,0:13:46.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think of my garden?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.84,0:13:49.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就是我的灵感
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:49.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were my inspiration
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.85,0:13:50.97,标准-Chi,,800,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:50.97,标准-Eng,,800,0,0,,Oh my
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.22,0:13:53.10,标准-Chi,,800,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:53.10,标准-Eng,,800,0,0,,It's beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.27,0:13:55.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说什么  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:55.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What was that, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.31,0:13:58.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:13:58.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.90,0:14:01.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对于业余人士算还行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:01.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not bad for an amateur
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.77,0:14:03.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别来烦我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.77,0:14:03.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, leave me alone
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.78,0:14:06.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他说还行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:06.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He said it's not bad
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.49,0:14:09.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我干嘛要鼓励他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:09.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why did I encourage him?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.70,0:14:11.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要是还想赢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:11.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I'm still gonna win
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.33,0:14:14.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就得提升园艺技能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:14.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need to up my gardening game
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.79,0:14:57.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:57.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How are you doing this?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.54,0:14:59.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你连园艺天赋都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:14:59.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't even have a green thumb
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:14:59.62,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(918,920)}绿 手 指
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.54,0:15:03.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我确实没有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:03.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right, I don't
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.46,0:15:05.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我有绿脚趾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:05.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I do have green toes
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.22,0:15:18.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来要想大赛获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:18.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like if I'm gonna win this competition
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.52,0:15:22.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就得动用园艺手册最传统的古法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:20.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's time for the oldest trick
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:22.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in the gardening handbook
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.86,0:15:25.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搞破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:25.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,sabotage
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.90,0:15:32.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:32.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.03,0:15:33.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.03,0:15:33.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.24,0:15:37.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咋了  没工具不方便搞园艺吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:37.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What, is it too hard to garden without tools?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.20,0:15:39.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.20,0:15:39.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.25,0:15:40.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我才借了你的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:40.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's why I borrowed yours
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.96,0:15:45.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥所有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:45.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Property of Squidward"
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.38,0:15:46.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,果不其然
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:46.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Typical
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.96,0:15:51.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  园艺有好多地方我都不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.96,0:15:50.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy, there sure is a lot about gardening
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:51.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that I don't understand
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.76,0:15:59.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来看看你花园种满杂草还能长多好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:56.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see your garden grow
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:59.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when it's choked with weed seeds
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.52,0:16:08.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,起效了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:08.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's working
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.99,0:16:16.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:16.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.74,0:16:18.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这些种子一定贴错标签了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:18.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,These seeds must be mislabeled
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.46,0:16:29.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.46,0:16:29.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That does it
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.00,0:16:31.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再也不当大好章鱼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:31.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No more Mr. Nice Squid
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.67,0:16:34.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是时候出动重型武器了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:34.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to bring out the heavy artillery
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.64,0:16:39.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  小聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:39.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, wise guy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.39,0:16:43.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看你花园能不能撑得过放射性云团
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:43.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,let's see your garden survive a radioactive cloud
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.73,0:16:50.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,起效了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.73,0:16:50.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's working
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.61,0:16:53.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得凑近瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.61,0:16:53.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need to get closer
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.83,0:17:11.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许我还真有怨艺天赋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:11.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe I do have a gangrene thumb
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.76,0:17:14.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:14.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.38,0:17:18.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他花园怎么会更漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:18.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How is his garden becoming more beautiful?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.72,0:17:22.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就连他的竖笛草吹得都比我好听
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.72,0:17:22.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Even his clarinet plant plays better than me
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.69,0:17:30.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:30.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.48,0:17:34.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,园艺大赛评审开始四处巡回评分了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:32.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's time for the garden contest judges
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:34.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to make their rounds
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.19,0:17:38.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下该怎么赢得那个地中海假期啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.19,0:17:38.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How am I gonna win that Mediterranean vacation now?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.37,0:17:40.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的花园毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:40.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My garden is ruined
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.74,0:17:43.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:43.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm a loser
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.46,0:17:46.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,除非
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:46.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unless
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.62,0:17:50.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做出不可告人的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:50.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do the unspeakable
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.46,0:17:52.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:52.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.50,0:17:53.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,花园怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:53.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How's the garden?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.67,0:17:54.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,烂透了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.67,0:17:54.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Terrible
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.51,0:17:56.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完全被毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.51,0:17:56.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's completely ruined
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.76,0:17:58.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你一定要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.76,0:17:58.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've got to
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.85,0:18:00.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你一定要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:00.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've got to
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.27,0:18:06.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你一定要帮帮我  好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:06.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You gotta help me, all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.18,0:18:07.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.18,0:18:07.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help me
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.36,0:18:14.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然好啊  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:14.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.03,0:18:16.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很乐意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.03,0:18:16.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My pleasure
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.11,0:18:19.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.11,0:18:19.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.36,0:18:20.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这花园
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:20.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's very
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.53,0:18:22.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常前卫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.53,0:18:22.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,avant-garden
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.83,0:18:27.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:27.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you do it, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.21,0:18:30.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么可以这么快就种出自己的花园
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.21,0:18:30.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you grow your garden so quickly?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.75,0:18:33.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,首先  我会确保每一颗种子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.75,0:18:33.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First, I make sure that each and every seed
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.42,0:18:34.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都感受到自己被关爱着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:34.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,knows that it is loved
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.59,0:18:40.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:40.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.47,0:18:41.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.47,0:18:41.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And then?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.76,0:18:44.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后就到处喷这个奇迹植物生长秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.76,0:18:43.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then I spray everything
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:44.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with this miracle plant grow formula
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.72,0:18:47.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我在文艺复兴节跟一个德鲁伊买的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:47.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that I bought from a druid at the Renaissance fair
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:47.14,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 德鲁伊：古凯尔特祭祀，崇敬自然，重视植物 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.27,0:18:49.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你一定在开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.27,0:18:49.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.10,0:18:52.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,并不  我从不拿德鲁伊开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:52.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I would never kid about druids
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.77,0:18:53.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.77,0:18:53.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Check it out
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.20,0:19:07.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,同时  在镇对面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:18.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(606,204)}拉里健身房
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.26,0:19:23.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给他们瞧瞧你们的能耐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:23.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Show 'em what you're working with, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.40,0:19:36.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,评审绝对不会发现
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:36.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The judges won't notice
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.78,0:19:40.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的摇钱树上少了一块钱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:40.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if one dollar is missing from me money tree
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.95,0:19:47.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,钱钱钱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.95,0:19:47.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Money, money, money
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.58,0:19:49.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,钱钱钱钱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:49.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Money, money, money, money
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.58,0:19:50.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:50.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep stepping
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:56.96,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(590,702)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.59,0:20:02.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:02.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.97,0:20:05.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没见过海霸园吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.97,0:20:05.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never seen a chum garden before?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.24,0:20:29.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干什么要那么久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:29.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's taking you so long?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.75,0:20:31.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,评审朝这边过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.75,0:20:31.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The judges are headed this way
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.96,0:20:33.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大自然母亲是催不得的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:33.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One cannot rush Mother Nature
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.12,0:20:35.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:35.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch me
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.88,0:20:36.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心点  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:36.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Careful, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.96,0:20:38.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那东西劲很大
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:38.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that stuff is strong
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.59,0:20:39.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好  我都懂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:39.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I got it
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.75,0:20:41.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快滚  爱乱跳的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.75,0:20:41.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now beat it, skippy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.42,0:20:42.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:42.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.22,0:20:50.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下可好  这玩意最好别洗不掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:50.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, great, this stuff better not stain
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.98,0:20:57.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:57.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.61,0:21:00.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好奇妙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.61,0:21:00.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And so whimsical
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.90,0:21:03.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:03.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Indeed
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.86,0:21:04.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很高兴你们喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.86,0:21:04.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Glad you like it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.16,0:21:08.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们应该现在就在这颁发头奖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:08.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think we should give first prize right here and now
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.37,0:21:10.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不参赛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:10.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't compete
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.54,0:21:12.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,单纯种着玩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:12.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just garden for the thrill of it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.50,0:21:17.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,何况裤头村真正的美好花园就在隔壁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:14.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Besides, the real jewel
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.58,0:21:17.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of Bikini Bottom gardens is next door
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.58,0:21:18.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.58,0:21:18.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.47,0:21:27.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好壮观啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:27.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Tis truly glorious
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.80,0:21:30.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美到让我无法呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:30.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My breath is taken away
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.81,0:21:33.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们真的喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.81,0:21:33.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You really like it?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.85,0:21:35.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.85,0:21:35.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who said that?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.23,0:21:36.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看上面
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:36.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Up here
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.73,0:21:43.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这才是我所谓的为园艺献身
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:43.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call dedication to gardening
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.36,0:21:46.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可是我见过最神奇的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.36,0:21:46.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the most amazing thing I've ever seen
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.28,0:21:47.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.28,0:21:47.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.95,0:21:49.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我美极了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.95,0:21:49.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.83,0:21:51.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凝望我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.83,0:21:51.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gaze upon me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.12,0:21:54.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该给他颁发头奖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.12,0:21:54.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We should award him first prize
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.91,0:21:56.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,同意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.91,0:21:56.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Agreed
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.37,0:21:58.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恭喜你  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.37,0:21:58.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.21,0:21:59.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道你做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:21:59.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.58,0:22:00.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我赢了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:00.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I won?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.00,0:22:02.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我真的赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:02.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I really won
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.59,0:22:05.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,地中海  我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.59,0:22:05.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mediterranean Sea, here I come
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.93,0:22:09.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等  我扎根在这了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:09.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm rooted in place
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.51,0:22:13.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都扎根了还能怎么旅游
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.51,0:22:13.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How can I travel if I'm rooted in place?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.56,0:22:15.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说得好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:15.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good point
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.98,0:22:17.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.98,0:22:17.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.56,0:22:21.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们代表你把假期赠送给你这位朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.56,0:22:21.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We give the vacation to your friend here on your behalf
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.77,0:22:23.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得可以
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.77,0:22:23.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Works for me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.53,0:22:26.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.53,0:22:26.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.86,0:22:29.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你永远都可以指望我玩得开心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.86,0:22:29.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can count on me to have a great time
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.82,0:22:30.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,替你玩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.82,0:22:30.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for you
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.20,0:22:36.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,起码我可算能清净了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.20,0:22:36.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, at least I'll get some peace and quiet
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.96,0:22:41.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从我身上下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:41.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get off me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.42,0:22:43.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:43.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop it
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.25,0:22:43.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要闹
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.25,0:22:43.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cut it out
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.84,0:22:47.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别咬了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.84,0:22:47.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop the nibbling
